{"ref":"passive:spellbinder","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Spellbinder is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by getting the ",{"i":"Sprite-Runetracer.png","w":17,"h":17,"r":"weapon:runetracer"}," ",{"t":"Runetracer","r":"weapon:runetracer"}," to Level 7."]},{"k":"p","c":["Spellbinder increases ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}," by 10% per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Spellbinder is required for the evolution of ",{"i":"Sprite-King_Bible.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:king-bible"}," ",{"t":"King Bible","r":"weapon:king-bible"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Unholy_Vespers.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:unholy-vespers"}," ",{"t":"Unholy Vespers","r":"weapon:unholy-vespers"},". It is also required for the evolution of ",{"i":"Sprite-Mille_Bolle_Blu.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:mille-bolle-blu"}," ",{"t":"Mille Bolle Blu","r":"weapon:mille-bolle-blu"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Boo_Roo_Boolle.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:boo-roo-boolle"}," ",{"t":"Boo Roo Boolle","r":"weapon:boo-roo-boolle"},", in which Spellbinder must also be fully leveled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Spellbinder can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", and ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["DURATION"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Spellbinder has 5 levels. At max level, Spellbinder provides +50% ",{"t